B.UB=s(["Arunachal Pradesh consists of 28 administrative districts.","27th District: Keyi Panyor (HQ: Yachuli) \u2014 carved out of Lower Subansiri on 1st March 2024.","28th District: Bichom (HQ: Napangphung) \u2014 carved out of West Kameng & East Kameng on 7th March 2024 (youngest district).","Largest District by Area: Dibang Valley.","Most Populous District: Papum Pare (176,573).","Least Populous District: Dibang Valley (8,004).","Highest Population Density: Papum Pare (51/sq. km).","Lowest Population Density: Dibang Valley (1 person/sq. km)."],t.s)
